{"text":"There's another link that binds us. More than a hundred years ago, America welcomed a son of India, Swami Vivekananda. And Swami Vivekananda helped bring Hinduism and yoga to our country. And he came to my hometown of Chicago, and there, at a great gathering of religious leaders, where she spoke of his faith and the divinity in every soul and the purity of love. And he began his speech with a simple greeting, Sisters and Brothers of America. So today, let me say, Sisters and Brothers of India. My confidence in what our nations can achieve together is rooted in the values that we share for we may have our different histories and speak different languages. But when we look at each other, we see a reflection of ourselves.","words":[{"text":"There's","start":1.14,"end":1.78},{"text":"another","start":1.78,"end":1.98},{"text":"link","start":1.98,"end":2.3},{"text":"that","start":2.3,"end":2.7},{"text":"binds","start":2.7,"end":2.94},{"text":"us","start":2.94,"end":3.36,"punct":"."},{"text":"More","start":3.6,"end":3.74},{"text":"than","start":3.74,"end":3.9},{"text":"a","start":3.9,"end":3.98},{"text":"hundred","start":3.98,"end":4.22},{"text":"years","start":4.22,"end":4.5},{"text":"ago","start":4.5,"end":4.82,"punct":","},{"text":"America","start":6.02,"end":6.46},{"text":"welcomed","start":6.46,"end":7.08},{"text":"a","start":7.08,"end":7.44},{"text":"son","start":7.44,"end":7.66},{"text":"of","start":7.66,"end":8.3},{"text":"India","start":8.3,"end":8.6,"punct":","},{"text":"Swami","start":9.88,"end":10.2},{"text":"Vivekananda","start":10.2,"end":13.3,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":16.06,"end":16.7},{"text":"Swami","start":16.7,"end":17.34},{"text":"Vivekananda","start":17.34,"end":18.2},{"text":"helped","start":18.2,"end":18.92},{"text":"bring","start":18.92,"end":19.34},{"text":"Hinduism","start":19.34,"end":20.08},{"text":"and","start":20.08,"end":20.34},{"text":"yoga","start":20.34,"end":20.58},{"text":"to","start":20.58,"end":21.46},{"text":"our","s